4) the copy makes no promise the numbers contradict
   nba: Spin the wheel of NBA history, draft one player per stop, and chase the best record you can. 82-0 takes a 95 plus roster and a lucky sim, and the odds are printed on every result.
   nhl: Spin the wheel of hockey history, draft one player per stop, and chase the best record you can. 82-0 takes an 89 plus lineup and a lucky sim, and the odds are printed on every result.
   mlb: Spin the wheel of baseball history, draft one player per stop, and chase 116 wins, the big league record. A perfect 162-0 needs a lineup the wheel almost never deals, and the odds are printed on every result.
   nfl: Spin the wheel of NFL history, draft one player per stop, and chase the best record you can. 17-0 takes an 83 plus roster and a lucky sim, and the odds are printed on every result.

simPerfectSeasonOdds: green. In all four sports the odds on the card are the odds in the sim, the copy agrees with both, and the best record keeps.
